# Credentials: excluded by pattern, not by path, so a file added later
# (e.g. a new package's provider secrets) is excluded by default instead
# of by someone remembering to list it.
#
# This file only applies to builds whose context is the repository root.
# packages/ingress-reverse-proxy is built with its own directory as the
# context, so it has its own .dockerignore.
**/*.ini
**/.env
**/.env.*
